OL,3,GNEWSATens of thousands expected at
OL,4,Aagricultural show
OL,5,
OL,6,FTens of thousands of people are
OL,7,Fexpected to attend the Newbury Show
OL,8,Fover the weekend.
OL,10,FAttractions at the two-day agricultural
OL,11,Fevent, which will be held at the
OL,12,FNewbury Showground, will include
OL,13,Flivestock shows, rural crafts and
OL,14,Fhave-a-go activities.
OL,16,FThe annual event was cancelled in 2020
OL,17,Fdue to the pandemic before it returned
OL,18,Fin 2023.
OL,20,FOrganisers said they wanted to present
OL,21,Fthe "very best of British agriculture
OL,22,Fand countryside to the general public".
